      </td>
     <td><para unique="1012564">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1012566">SSE2</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1012568">Return the bitwise logical XOR of packed double precision floating-point values in xmm1 and xmm2/mem.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1012570">VEX.128.66.0F.WIG 57 /r</para>
      <para unique="1012571">VXORPD xmm1,xmm2, xmm3/m128</para>
